      "en": "Even now the ax also lies at the root of the trees. Every tree therefore that doesn’t produce good fruit is cut down and thrown into the fire.”",
      "ko": "이미 도끼가 나무 뿌리에 놓였으니 좋은 열매 맺지 아니하는 나무마다 찍혀 불에 던지우리라",
      "source_text_hash": "ea52dea3ae122be58491e608f41944d978e513723eabb85ebde374c4b92febe6",
      "translation_text_hash": "561e52043ebfbb040c7872aecf317a025ead4487171f7b12fc0135eda82935c2",
