      "en": "The multitudes asked him, “What then must we do?”",
      "ko": "무리가 물어 가로되 그러하면 우리가 무엇을 하리이까",
      "source_text_hash": "a92dcfb01dd5df826af70453ae22c6c61f47b3003748fd1a548d9320a85b1941",
      "translation_text_hash": "f3fc8401ee41299672e4c07070f453e4ab0fe1d48fb6ec382a00f7eca1987f83",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
