      "en": "He said to them, “Collect no more than that which is appointed to you.”",
      "ko": "가로되 정한 세 외에는 늑징치 말라하고",
      "source_text_hash": "4150a2b3c68c1c712dece9429201423ebdada7f0ca27d6df10a70cf5075ace4e",
